        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The Colorado Rockies put new associates on registers in five minutes after they start. The iOS interface follows familiar design patterns that most people already know. For stadium retail where staff might work 20 games a year, this virtually eliminates training overhead.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How does Teamwork Commerce compare to retailcloud for stadium merchandise?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
